            "review_title": "Review at Bar SJ",
            "review_text": "JUJU\n7 contributions\n0\ntasty, juicy, satisfying\nSep 2023 • Friends\nI rarely write reviews, but I couldn’t remain indifferent after visiting this place. We were pleasantly surprised by the presence of such a place in Vietnam. After all, the interior of this bar is not Vietnamese at all. When we came here, we completely forgot that we were in Vietnam. It’s a cool place for photos, I think you understand what I’m talking about😉. The menu is not large, and that has its own charm. We ordered an SJ burger, a cheeseburger, baby burgers, a mojito, a nigroni and a Hoegaarden beer. The burgers come with fries, onion rings, two sauces and jalapeños. We ate buffalo for the first time, and we liked it, the perfect combination of all ingredients, the burgers were juicy, the meat was tender, the sauce was excellent. The cocktails are refreshing, rich in taste, Hoegaarden beer is chic, cool and fresh. We are very pleased with our visit to this bar. Open until 2 am, this is important for us because we love to eat at night, and finding a place with European food in Vietnam is not an easy task. As a result, we received aesthetic and taste pleasure. And we want to say thank you 😘 for such a place.\nRead more\nWritten September 21, 2023",
